<h3 class="bold" id="steps-to-follow-when-applying-spacing-values"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="general-rules#steps-to-follow-when-applying-spacing-values">Steps to follow when applying spacing values</a></h3>
<p><strong>1.</strong><br/>
When creating a new section or an entire page, <strong>firstly check the already defined
components and patterns</strong>. There may already exist something that fits your needs.</p>
<p><strong>2.</strong><br/>
If you have checked those and are <strong>sure you need to create something new, apply
the following rules</strong> to your proposal.</p>
